{"name": "Nether Spirits: Beyond the Gate", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"439\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/4417a4946051dfb50c9347db1f1769ba.poster.avif?t=1787065373\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/4417a4946051dfb50c9347db1f1769ba.webm?t=1787065373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><br/>Nether Spirits blends a rich, story-driven solo roguelike deckbuilder with seamless co-op and PvP battles\u2014forge your path, perfect your deck, and reclaim your soul alone or alongside others.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solo, Co-op &amp; PvP</h2>Explore the Nether alone, join instant drop-in/drop-out co-op with anyone, or challenge others in 1v1 and 2v2 PvP\u2014whenever and wherever you want!<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"439\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/13577c2b2b6ea00024145007895c9f8d.poster.avif?t=1787065373\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/13577c2b2b6ea00024145007895c9f8d.webm?t=1787065373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Combat With New Strategic Depths</h2>Plan your turn in advance with the Timeline system: queue and chain cards for game-breaking combos, unleash a flurry of attacks at once, or  tweak plays mid-turn before they resolve.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"439\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/183fa8623920b29e1b517cf7b792ad34.poster.avif?t=1787065373\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/183fa8623920b29e1b517cf7b792ad34.webm?t=1787065373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover The Secrets of the Nether</h2>Travel the vast expanse of the Nether and discover its dark history. Explore age-old ruins in search of lore and treasure, meet compelling characters and help them on their way, or venture into hostile forests thick with fog and mystery - there is no wrong path, only your own.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/7a43e0ae67379516493fb46b8baa1223.poster.avif?t=1787065373\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/7a43e0ae67379516493fb46b8baa1223.webm?t=1787065373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/7a43e0ae67379516493fb46b8baa1223.mp4?t=1787065373\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Interested? Join the Adventure NOW!</h2>Add Nether Spirits to your wishlist and join our Discord for the latest news and community chats!<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"439\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0891a401334c6f11ec7ac82fcf5787d6.poster.avif?t=1787065373\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0891a401334c6f11ec7ac82fcf5787d6.webm?t=1787065373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><br/><br/><i>Note: All images shown are from a version still in development. The final product may differ from the materials presented here.</i> </div>", "short_desc": "Roguelike deckbuilder meets dark fantasy: Choose one of seven unique classes, explore the vast nether, and fight for salvation - solo, in co-op, or PvP!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/f1f797b2abdff3043a3606431d1ea8bc523d8b67/header.jpg?t=1787065373", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Horror", "Mythology", "Stylized", "Fantasy", "Magic", "Roguelike Deckbuilder"], "developers": "Spellfusion", "publishers": "Spellfusion", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1607760", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "24 July 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/vKq_REUbQn4", "first_seen": 1753315200.0, "review_rank": 1545}